<title>AUSTRIA: GGC OPEC MINISTERS TO MEET TOMORROW-GULF SOURCES.</title>
<headline>GGC OPEC MINISTERS TO MEET TOMORROW-GULF SOURCES.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil ministers of the Gulf Cooperation Council (GCC), comprising Saudi Arabia, Kuwait, the United Arab Emirates and Qater, will meet in Vienna on Tuesday ahead of an OPEC ministerial meeting on Wednesday, Gulf sources said.</p>
<p>&quot;There will be a meeting with GCC ministers tomorrow,&quot; said one source.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 713 2002</p>
</text>
